WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.880
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an American science fiction film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Planet of the Apes 2001.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:23.680
The premise of the movie is set in the year 2029.&nbsp;
Captain Leo Davidson is an astronaut aboard the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:29.520
United States Air Force space station, Oberon.&nbsp;
He and his team are with apes who are specially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:34.320
trained for space missions. At the beginning&nbsp;
of the movie, we are introduced to one of such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:40.320
chimpanzees named Pericles. He works closely&nbsp;
with the captain and is very good at his job.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:45.680
Leo receives a video message from his friends on&nbsp;
earth but while watching it, the lights go out and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.200
the electronic devices start to malfunction. The&nbsp;
flickering of the lights causes the animals aboard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.040
to panic. Leo is asked to report to the bridge to&nbsp;
discuss the malfunction. He is then informed about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:03.040
an electromagnetic storm approaching the space&nbsp;
station. The standard procedure is to send an ape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:08.240
to take initial radiation and gamma-ray readings&nbsp;
and make sure the storm is safe for a human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:14.560
astronaut to approach. Leo’s superior asks him to&nbsp;
get Pericles ready for the trip. Leo retaliates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:19.840
and claims that it is his job as a captain to&nbsp;
report the initial readings but everyone else&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:30.640
asks him to follow the standard procedure. 
He then prepares Pericles for the mission. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:36.320
creature is seated in a small pod that he pilots&nbsp;
to the storm. Only some minutes after the takeoff,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:42.720
the scientists notice that the pod is off course&nbsp;
and Pericles’s heart rate is rising. Eventually,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:49.200
they lose the track of the pod and declare that it&nbsp;
is lost. Leo sneaks into a pod and launches into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:54.960
space to get the chimp even though his superiors&nbsp;
ask him to return. He gets a visual of the pod&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:01.520
that Pericles is in but before he can report it,&nbsp;
his pod crashes into a massive foreign object.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:08.400
After the impact, he loses all signals from the&nbsp;
space station. He, yet again crashes into a bright&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:14.720
wormhole. The pod malfunctions and crashes into a&nbsp;
planet's surface that looks a lot like the earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:20.320
Leo lands on a water body and somehow survives&nbsp;
the crash. He walks around exploring the forest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.520
he is in. The first person he meets is a man&nbsp;
who seems to be a native of the jungle. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.320
man and a group behind him are running away&nbsp;
from wild apes who are chasing them. 
&nbsp;

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:36.240
Without thinking much about it, Leo also starts to&nbsp;
run with them. The apes wear armor for protection&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:41.680
and seem to be more advanced than humans. They&nbsp;
abduct most of the group as the surviving ones&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:48.240
try to run away. All of them, including Leo, are&nbsp;
eventually enslaved and taken away in a human-run&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:54.080
carriage. They reach a civilization of humanoid&nbsp;
apes where humans are used for household works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.080 --> 00:03:00.480
and entertainment and the apes run the society.&nbsp;
The ape kids throw stones at the captured humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:06.800
calling them dirty. We are introduced to a female&nbsp;
ape, Ari who supports human rights and protests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:12.160
the way they are treated in society. She scolds&nbsp;
the kids and tells them to respect all beings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:20.640
The slaves are then sold to a dealer. After they&nbsp;
are put into the cages, a little ape child buys a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:26.480
human girl to keep her as a pet. The adults are&nbsp;
dragged out and marked with a hot iron stick.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:32.240
Ari intervenes and asks the dealer to be less&nbsp;
ruthless to humans because they also have rights.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:37.520
Leo takes this opportunity to grab the&nbsp;
iron rod and hold her hostage. He whispers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:43.120
to her to help him escape this place. 
A human girl named Daena also tries to run away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:48.880
but is caught by the dealer. He claims that he&nbsp;
will have to put down both Leo and Daena. To save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:54.880
their lives, Ari asks the dealer to sell them to&nbsp;
her. The dealer is reluctant at first but agrees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.880 --> 00:04:00.240
anyway. Ari’s father is a well-respected senator&nbsp;
who doesn’t like that Ari has brought two wild&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:05.520
humans into his house. He asks her to keep them&nbsp;
in check because he will soon have guests over.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:11.840
One of the guests is General Thade, a sadistic&nbsp;
chimpanzee military commander who wants control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:17.280
over the ape civilization. When Leo and Daena are&nbsp;
alone in the kitchen, he asks her how the monkeys&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:22.480
managed to get more powerful than humans. Daena&nbsp;
claims that they have always been that way. Leo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:27.200
is then taken outside to serve the guests.&nbsp;
As the guests engage in a conversation, Leo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:33.360
overhears Thade saying that humans outnumber apes&nbsp;
by a large number. Ari puts forward her ideas of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:39.200
equality between humans and apes but Thade claims&nbsp;
that her principles threaten the ape’s prosperity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:44.400
When Leo comes to serve the table, Thade&nbsp;
forcefully opens his mouth and mocks him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.480
Ari leaves the table at the sight and Thade&nbsp;
follows her behind. It turns out that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:53.840
been asking her to marry him for quite some time&nbsp;
but because of his cold soul, she refuses. 
&nbsp;

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:05.840
After dinner, Leo and Daena are locked inside&nbsp;
a cage with the house slaves. At night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:11.520
Leo manages to open the cage and run away with&nbsp;
Daena and the other humans. Daena insists that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:16.880
she won’t run away without her family who is still&nbsp;
locked up in the dealership. They run to the said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:22.080
dealership and free her father and the other&nbsp;
human slaves. Following that, the group makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:27.200
their way to the forest. Soon, the soldiers are&nbsp;
ordered to look for the escaped prisoners. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:33.520
murderous General Thade and his junior, Colonel&nbsp;
Attar, march ape warriors to pursue the humans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:39.040
While trying to run away, the group bumps into&nbsp;
Ari who agrees to help them at Leo’s request.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:44.480
However, before they can escape through a tunnel,&nbsp;
Colonel Attar approaches them. Daena’s father, who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:50.800
is already very injured, runs to fight the ape and&nbsp;
distract him. He sacrifices his life in the fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:56.240
but because of him, the others run away safely.
Leo takes them to the lake that he had landed in.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.240 --> 00:06:01.760
We find out that the apes are terrified of water&nbsp;
because they cannot swim. Leo and Daena swim into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:07.600
the Lake and retrieve a bag from the crashed pod.&nbsp;
It contains a gun and a beacon that Leo uses to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:12.480
send a signal to the space station. He receives&nbsp;
data that says that the space station is already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:19.120
in the atmosphere, most probably looking for him.&nbsp;
Just then, the dealer Limbo attacks them and tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:24.560
to abduct one of the humans. Leo threatens him&nbsp;
with the gun and holds him hostage because if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:29.760
let him go, he will lead the others to the group.&nbsp;
After that, they continue to follow the signal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:35.040
received by the beacon to help Leo go back&nbsp;
home. Meanwhile, back in the town, Thade&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:40.880
asks the senator for absolute power to eradicate&nbsp;
the humans. He wants to take the opportunity to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:46.560
expand his power and eventually rule the world&nbsp;
of apes. The senator believes that his daughter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:52.560
was abducted by the humans, so he does as Thade&nbsp;
says and provides him with full authority. 
&nbsp;

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:58.720
Thade’s father gets severely sick so he is called&nbsp;
to meet him. In his place, General Krull goes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:05.200
stop the humans. Thade’s father is the only man he&nbsp;
trusts and respects. The old ape knows something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:10.800
that the younger generation doesn’t. Thade asks&nbsp;
his father about the source of his knowledge.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.520
The father ape then tells him about the first&nbsp;
of their kind named the Semos. Before the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:20.800
arrival of Semos, the apes were the slaves to&nbsp;
humans who ruled the society. Thade believes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:26.640
it to be impossible but his father continues the&nbsp;
explanation. He reveals a hidden old gun and says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:32.560
that humans possess the power of invention and&nbsp;
technology which is greater than their strength.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:38.320
The old ape begs his son to not let the humans&nbsp;
get to a place called the Calima. It is the holy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:43.760
temple of Semos that holds the secret of their&nbsp;
true origin. If the humans find out about it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:49.600
they will retaliate and destroy the ape’s world.&nbsp;
In the meantime, the group of escapees makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:55.520
their way to Camila where Leo believes his team is&nbsp;
waiting for him. When they reach closer, they see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.520 --> 00:08:01.040
scarecrows made to keep the apes and the humans&nbsp;
away from the holy temple. They finally get to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:06.880
a checkpoint where camps of apes have been settled&nbsp;
to guard the way to the temple. General Krull also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:12.880
arrives there and takes command of the troops.
When the sun sets, Leo creates a distraction using&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:18.800
his gun and makes his way to the camp on horses.&nbsp;
He and the group manage to set the camp on fire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:24.000
and cross the river which is the only obstacle&nbsp;
between them and the temple of Semos. A while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:29.840
later, Thade arrives at the camp and is furious at&nbsp;
the troops for not being able to stop the humans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:34.800
He gathers them all and sets off to look for the&nbsp;
enemies from the other side of the mountain. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:40.560
escapees, on the other hand, rest for the night&nbsp;
and reach the Semos’s temple the next day. Leo is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:46.240
beyond surprised when he sees that the temple is&nbsp;
actually the space station, Oberon, that he left&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:51.360
a few days ago. Ari claims that it is impossible&nbsp;
because the temple has been there for thousands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:57.600
of years. Since the station is powered by nuclear&nbsp;
energy, Leo is able to retrieve visual logs to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:03.280
what actually happened to his ship. Then, he finds&nbsp;
out that when he entered the wormhole, he jumped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:10.720
through time and reached the year 5021. The Oberon&nbsp;
remained in the year 2029 and looked for him. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:15.520
were never able to find him and the station&nbsp;
eventually crashed to this planet’s surface&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:22.240
in 2029. The apes that were aboard the Oberon went&nbsp;
wild and started to attack the crew members. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:28.880
eventually, one of the apes named Semos stopped&nbsp;
them and led the way. As time passed, the apes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:35.040
took over and the people Leo is with currently&nbsp;
are the descendants of his fellow crew members.
&nbsp;

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:40.800
Now, he has no way to return home. When he steps&nbsp;
out of the ruins of the Oberon, several humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:46.160
surround him. They have heard the story about the&nbsp;
brave human and want to help him fight the apes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.280
But Leo knows that they will not be able to win&nbsp;
against thousands of apes who are coming for them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:56.960
He asks them to run away but they stay put in&nbsp;
their decisions. Then, he thinks of an idea.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:03.120
Since the Oberon has plenty of nuclear fuel, he&nbsp;
plans to use it to fire a final blast at apes when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:09.360
they arrive. He makes all the humans hide behind&nbsp;
the spaceship and uses the escapees as bait to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:15.200
invite the apes. When the first batch of apes is&nbsp;
close enough, the nuclear blast sends them flying.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:21.760
However, soon after Thade and the second batch of&nbsp;
the army attack them. They start to overpower the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:27.040
humans with their strength. Leo and Thade get&nbsp;
into a fierce battle but stop when they notice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:33.840
a familiar ship landing from the sky. It contains&nbsp;
Pericles who had also been lost in the wormhole.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:39.280
It turns out the electromagnetic storm actually&nbsp;
releases people from it in an opposite direction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:44.240
in time to their entrance,that explains&nbsp;
why Pericles arrived a few days after Leo.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:53.280
The apes then bow, interpreting his arrival as&nbsp;
the return of Semos, and hostilities between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:58.000
humans and apes suddenly cease. 
Ignoring everyone, Pericles runs into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:02.800
the remains of the Oberon and Leo runs&nbsp;
after him, followed by General Thade.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:09.760
Thade wants to end Pericles to attain absolute&nbsp;
power but Leo stops him. The two get into a fight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:15.600
Leo’s gun lands inside the pilot’s deck during the&nbsp;
struggle. Thade goes inside to retrieve it but is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:21.600
trapped when Leo locks the automatic door. The&nbsp;
enraged ape fires the gun repeatedly at the door&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:27.920
but the ricochets create sparks that scare him. He&nbsp;
hides under a control panel, accepting his defeat.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:33.920
Deciding to return to Earth, Leo gives Pericles&nbsp;
to Ari, who promises to look after him. He tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:39.680
everyone that humans and apes are supposed to&nbsp;
live in peace and harmony, it was Semos’s wish all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:46.480
along. After saying farewell to Ari and Daena, Leo&nbsp;
climbs aboard Pericles's undamaged pod and travels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:52.800
back in time through the same electromagnetic&nbsp;
storm, and crashes in Washington, D.C. on Earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:58.240
He looks up at what appears to be the Lincoln&nbsp;
Memorial, only to find that it is now a monument&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:04.560
memorializing General Thade. A swarm of police&nbsp;
officers, firefighters, and news reporters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:09.600
all of whom are apes, descend upon him.
Now for the explanation of the ending..we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:14.000
can assume that Leo has entered into the&nbsp;
future because of the electromagnetic storm.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.800
It is likely that after Leo’s departure from&nbsp;
the previous planet, Thade somehow managed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:24.080
to break free and travelled to Earth through the&nbsp;
same electromagnetic storm. He was then released&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:29.280
to earth thousands of years before Leo’s arrival.&nbsp;
Because the ape was kicked out of his planet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:35.600
he managed to rule the earth and overthrow&nbsp;
humans. And now everyone on earth is ape!
